<item>
<title><![CDATA[The tomatoes finally gave up, and I feel fine about it]]></title>
<link>https://bubbledew.example/the-tomatoes-finally-gave-up/</link>
<pubDate>2026-10-04 09:10:00</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://bubbledew.example/?p=101</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Six weeks of nursing split skins and blossom-end rot taught me more than the two good months before it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The raised bed on the north side never drained. I knew it in May, I knew it in June, and I kept watering anyway, because the plants looked thirsty and I am a soft touch.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Next year: a drainage layer, two fewer plants, and a promise to read the soil rather than the leaves.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Six weeks of nursing split skins and blossom-end rot taught me more than the two good months before it. Here is what I am changing for next year, starting with the raised bed that never drained.]]></excerpt:encoded>
