<title><![CDATA[Sunday, mostly spent watching the light move across one wall]]></title>
<link>https://bubbledew.example/sunday-light/</link>
<pubDate>2026-09-21 16:00:00</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://bubbledew.example/?p=103</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>No plans, a pot of tea, and the slow realisation that the north-facing room is the best room in the house for exactly ninety minutes in October.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>I moved the chair twice to follow it. The cat did the same, with more conviction.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
